  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Imágenes|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_0939.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La Font de Dins de Onda ha acogido esta tarde un desfile de moda solidario a beneficio de la ONG Karit. Presentado por Ram&oacute;n Cabedo han colaborado 28 comercios ondenses, el Ayuntamiento, CAja Rural, Amics del Centre Hist&ograve;ric y Onda Centre Comercial. Han desfilado unas 120 personas, entre ellas 95 ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as. Los peinados han estado a cargo de Lluna Estilistes y Peluquer&iacute;a Raquel. El bar Les Tasques ha obsequiado con una rosa a las chicas y un detalle a los chicos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilemodakarit/img_0904.jpg\" alt=\"img_0904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilemodakarit/img_0905.jpg\" alt=\"img_0905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilemodakarit/img_0906.jpg\" alt=\"img_0906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilemodakarit/img_0907.jpg\" alt=\"img_0907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilemodakarit/img_0908.jpg\" alt=\"img_0908\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilemodakarit/img_0909.jpg\" alt=\"img_0909\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilemodakarit/img_0910.jpg\" alt=\"img_0910\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfilemodakarit/img_0911.jpg\" alt=\"img_0911\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-